# salt-radar port of btop++'s kanagawa-dragon.theme
# (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop, Apache-2.0)
#
# Bashtop Kanagawa-dragon (https://github.com/rebelot/kanagawa.nvim) theme
# By: Marcus441
#
# The status, pulse and highlight colors salt-radar adds come from
# the Kanagawa palette.

